<title>UK: Norddeutsche Hypo adds 50 mln Dem to step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Norddeutsche Hypo adds 50 mln Dem to step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 150 million marks from 100 million marks, lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0	 MATURITY   *18.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE  S-18.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    HAMBURG   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 18.JUL.97, THEN STEPS UP TO 4.95 PCT IF NOT</p>
<p>		CALLED AT PAR. S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		ORIGINAL 100 MLN MARK BOND LAUNCHED 10.APR</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 455</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
